From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:20:19 -0643
Subject: [PATCH] soc: google: aoc: Clear the heaps on zumapro before the first
 start

Android creates the AoC's sensor, playback and capture heaps with its
physical-heap constructors, which clear them at probe. This port lays
the heaps out without creating them, so on zumapro clear the three
together (they're contiguous at the top of the carve-out) before the
firmware is first authenticated.

On the Pixel 9a this is part of the composition that runs,
7.3.0-rc6-omamobile-tegu-s2mpg15-m1-g991042e2eff3-dirty, where the
same clearing is behind a bring-up parameter that every start since
2026-10-25 has set. On its own it didn't fix the firmware's startup
fault (that was the DVFS query); it is kept so the firmware sees the
memory Android gives it.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.c | 14 ++++++++++++++
 drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.h |  1 +
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.c b/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.c
index 6e8ae5144..366bdca83 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.c
@@ -1248,6 +1248,7 @@ static const struct aoc_soc_data gs201_aoc_data = {
 static const struct aoc_soc_data zumapro_aoc_data = {
 	.ordered_sensor_supplies = true,
 	.firmware_managed_mmu = true,
+	.zero_heaps = true,
 	.chipid_main_reg = 0,
 	.chipid_main_shift = 0,
 	.pcu_base = 0x1400000,
@@ -2545,6 +2546,19 @@ bool aoc_create_dma_buf_heaps(struct aoc_prvdata *prvdata)
 	base -= CAPTURE_HEAP_SIZE;
 	prvdata->audio_capture_heap_base = base;
 
+	/*
+	 * Android's heap constructors clear the three heaps at probe; on
+	 * zumapro do the same before the firmware is ever authenticated.
+	 */
+	if (prvdata->soc->zero_heaps) {
+		memset_io((void __iomem *)prvdata->dram_virt +
+			  (base - prvdata->dram_resource.start), 0,
+			  CAPTURE_HEAP_SIZE + PLAYBACK_HEAP_SIZE +
+			  SENSOR_DIRECT_HEAP_SIZE);
+		/* Before any later authentication and start */
+		dma_wmb();
+	}
+
 	return true;
 }
 
diff --git a/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.h b/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.h
index 47359799f..f7468bea0 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.h
+++ b/drivers/soc/google/aoc/aoc.h
@@ -102,6 +102,7 @@ struct aoc_soc_data {
 	bool firmware_managed_mmu;
 	bool merge_subrevision_into_type;
 	bool force_vnom_default;
+	bool zero_heaps;
 	u32 chipid_main_reg;
 	u32 chipid_main_shift;
 	u32 pcu_base;
